mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小鹏人形机器人广州工厂开启小批量试生产 预计2026年实现量产</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，云业务运营利润率升至35.6%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">黑森林实验室发布FLUX3多模态模型，支持20秒音视频生成与机器人行为预测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbf511116b0653d1158ca75dacce62e6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Black Forest Labs正式推出FLUX3多模态基础模型，该模型采用统一架构联合学习图像、视频和音频，并基于Self-Flow自监督流匹配框架扩展。FLUX3支持单次生成最长20秒的视频并附带原生音频，具备文生视频、图生视频、视频续写及多镜头串联等多种创作模式。在人工评测中，FLUX3在10秒720p视频生成任务中表现优异，对比Grok Imagine Video胜率达69%，对比Seedance 2.0和Gemini Omni Flash胜率均为52%。除内容生成外，FLUX3还具备图像生成与编辑能力。目前，Black Forest Labs正与Mimic Robotics合作，探索将FLUX3应用于机器人行为预测，旨在将多模态AI能力从数字创作延伸至实体机器人领域，使其成为连接数字与物理世界的通用</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源0.8B参数文档解析模型OvisOCR2，登顶OmniDocBench基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cb30ff938973a12cf696bd77d1ded8b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月24日，阿里巴巴宣布开源0.8B参数规模的文档解析模型OvisOCR2。该模型在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中以96.58分登顶，成为首个超越传统流水线方法的端到端文档解析模型。OvisOCR2基于Qwen3.5-0.8B后训练，通过单模型一次生成即可输出包含文本、公式、表格与视觉区域的Markdown格式。技术上，该模型结合真实与合成数据，利用SFT、RL、OPD及模型融合技术提升性能。目前，OvisOCR2已在Hugging Face及魔搭社区以Apache 2.0协议开源，兼容vLLM推理框架。该模型通过小参数高效能特性，大幅降低了高精度文档解析的算力门槛，推动文档智能从复杂系统工程向模型驱动范式演进，为RAG检索与企业知识库构建提供了更轻量、高效的底层基础设施。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由姚顺雨统管基础模型部</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于7月23日正式宣布组织架构调整，将原混元多模态模型部门与大语言模型部门合并，新设立基础模型部，由腾讯首席AI科学家姚顺雨统一管理。此次重组旨在打破多模态与语言模型间的研发壁垒，提升模型研发协同效率，全力冲击全模态模型的智能上限。此前，姚顺雨已于去年12月兼任大语言模型部负责人，此次调整将“能看图”与“能对话”的技术路线收归同一指挥中枢。通过将多模态与语言模型研发力量整合，腾讯意在加速混元模型在全模态领域的深度融合与技术迭代，为后续构建更具竞争力的全模态模型奠定组织基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小鹏人形机器人广州工厂开启小批量试生产 预计2026年实现量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a520db4b78f82e0812178b1866d9796e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小鹏人形机器人广州工厂开启小批量试生产 预计2026年实现量产AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 24, 202650小鹏人形机器人近日在广州工厂正式开启小批量试生产，量产产线已进入最后联调阶段，标志着其量产冲刺进入倒计时。此前，小鹏集团董事长兼CEO何小鹏已亲自兼任机器人业务“CEO”，全面统筹并推进该业务的商业化落地进程。按照小鹏内部机器人量产动员大会规划，公司将于2026年正式实现人形机器人的量产，并计划自2027年起逐步进驻全球小鹏线下门店及相关商业场景，承担导购、讲解等服务职能。在技术与产业复用层面，小鹏机器人业务深入整合了集团在硬件开发、AI大模型、供应链管理及市场营销等多模块的核心能力，系统性复用汽车业务在软硬件协同研发、智能制造与全球化渠道建设中积累的成熟经验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，云业务运营利润率升至35.6%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布2026年第二季度财报，资本支出同比暴涨100%至创纪录的449.2亿美元，主要投向AI基础设施建设。得益于AI需求激增，Google Cloud营收同比增长82%达248亿美元，运营利润率从此前水平近乎翻倍至35.6%，积压订单规模达5140亿美元。在模型应用方面，Gemini月活用户已达9.5亿，其模型API每分钟处理的token量达到220亿。谷歌通过持续的高额资本投入，正试图在AI重写基础设施的周期中建立护城河。行业分析指出，超大规模云服务商的资本支出正处于高速增长期，预计到2027年全球相关支出将突破万亿美元大关，AI数据中心建设成为核心投入方向。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
